  m_text: "sn\u0313il\xED\u0294tn/Story Poles\r\nLes Louis, Syilx    2016\r\n\r\nCreated by Syilx artist Les Louis, sn\u0313il\xED\u0294tn is inspired by the frame of a traditional Syilx tule-mat lodge.\r\n\r\nIts seven poles represent the seven member communities of the Syilx Okanagan Nation.\r\n\r\nThe pictographs draw from ancestral symbols and the artist\u2019s interpretations, carrying Syilx teachings, histories, and stories across generations."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
